line	
line	<col=000080>Go to the <col=800000>Rising Sun Inn</col> in <col=800000>Falador</col> and talk to <col=800000>Emily</col> or <col=800000>Kaylee</col>. Pay her (<col=800000>Ring of Charos(a)</col> persuades her for free) to learn how to make <col=800000>Asgoldian ale</col>.</col>
step	6	-	Quick guide step 6
line	<str>Speak to the Lumbridge Cook.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to him again with items in inventory.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the door behind the Cook and watch the cutscene.</str>
line	
line	<str>Inspect the dwarf.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the Rising Sun Inn in Falador and talk to Emily or Kaylee. Pay her (Ring of Charos(a) persuades her for free) to learn how to make Asgoldian ale.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Use coins on your Asgarnian ales.</col>
