line	
line	<col=000080>If you have ice gloves, equip them and pick up the cake. Otherwise pick up the cake with regular gloves then kill an <col=800000>icefiend</col> (at <col=800000>Ice Mountain</col>) to cool the cake. If you forgot to use the ice gloves, you can drop the cake, equip your ice gloves, and pick the cake back up to cool it.</col>
